@Arcora.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5294

GET {{Arcora.Api_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### Start or resume a saved listing enquiry (set token from your own authenticated session)
POST {{Arcora.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Messaging/StartThread
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "listingID": "faaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa",
  "message": "Hi, is this home available for these dates?",
  "proposedStartDate": "2026-12-01",
  "proposedEndDate": "2027-06-01"
}

### Invalid listing ID returns 400
POST {{Arcora.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Messaging/StartThread
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "listingID": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "message": "Hi",
  "proposedStartDate": "2026-12-01",
  "proposedEndDate": "2027-06-01"
}

### Edit your own text message (sender only, within 5 minutes of sending)
PUT {{Arcora.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Messaging/EditMessage/aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Hi, is this home available from December?",
  "actor": { "tenantID": "bbbbbbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbbbbbbbbbb" }
}

### Toggle a reaction (same emoji removes it, a different emoji replaces it)
POST {{Arcora.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Messaging/ReactToMessage/aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emoji": "👍",
  "actor": { "organizationMemberID": "cccccccc-cccc-cccc-cccc-cccccccccccc" }
}
